# Models for lanes that have no default model. Copy to ~/.config/mmo/models (or point MMO_MODELS at
# a copy) and `mmo-roster probe` reads it. One `lane model` per line; several lines for one lane are
# each probed; `#` starts a comment. Use ids your own CLI or account accepts: these are examples.
#
# opencode: ids come from `opencode models`
# opencode opencode/big-pickle
# opencode openrouter/deepseek/deepseek-chat
#
# api: `endpoint:model` (keys for the endpoint go in ~/.config/mmo/keys.env, see docs/lanes/api.md)
# api openrouter:meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free
# api ollama:qwen3:8b
#
# cursor: ids from `cursor-agent --list-models`
# cursor composer-2.5
#
# agy: ids from the model picker of the Antigravity CLI
# agy gemini-4-neon-high
# agy gemini-4-hydrogen-high
#
# copilot: ids from `copilot --help` or your plan
# copilot gpt-6.1-sol
#
# A lane that already has a default (codex, grok, deepseek, kimi) can also be listed to probe more ids:
# codex gpt-6-astra
# grok grok-4.7-build-fast
